--- STREAMLIT & SECURITY ---

NEVER upload files containing actual credentials/passwords to GitHub!

.streamlit/secrets.toml
.env
secrets.toml
credentials.json

--- PYTHON SYSTEM FILES ---

Junk files generated by the Python interpreter

pycache/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.ipynb_checkpoints
.pytest_cache/

--- LOGS AND TEMPORARY DATA ---

Runtime logs and large data files that should stay local

*.log
pipeline_execution.log
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.db
*.sqlite3
*.out

--- VIRTUAL ENVIRONMENTS ---

Libraries installed via pip/conda (should be re-installed from requirements.txt)

venv/
env/
.venv/
bin/
include/
lib/
share/
pyvenv.cfg
